  (text "RAILS: DCBUS -> 12V (LM5164) -> 5V (LMR51430) -> 3.3V VCC (TLV75533) + 3.3V AVCC (TPS7A2033)\nBudgets: 12V rail <=1A total (5V stage ~0.46A + brake driver 0.05A + fan 0.15A); 5V rail spec 1A.\nFully independent of both gate drivers (DRV8353 bucks unused).\nProduction note: BOR Level 3 option bytes."
    (at 33.02 27.94 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
    )
    (uuid "384bc4d4-3133-4b7a-8cbb-991caf3be917")
  )
  (text "NT1: single AGND-GND tie at U23.  NT2: single GND-PGND tie, place near gate drivers U3/U4."
    (at 99.06 118.11 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
    )
    (uuid "2c97a0af-8dde-48c1-88ec-2b975407cf03")
  )
  (text "J5 silk: FAN 12V 150mA MAX"
    (at 238.76 54.61 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
    )
    (uuid "ad5613c1-9b39-4cd6-be15-18d710032437")
  )
  (text "5V PG: trip ~4.5V (26.1k/10k), -IN = VREF_OV 1.24V from sensing block.\nTLV7031 is open-drain: R119 10k pullup to VCC on PG_5V.\nPG_ALL = PG_12V AND PG_5V; 74LVC1G06 pulls nFAULT low on any rail failure."
    (at 137.16 158.75 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
    )
    (uuid "14fa4ce0-e416-401a-917b-406bf022884f")
  )
